Error [E0998]: explicit mutable binding uses `name: Type :=`, not `name: Type :=`
  --> tests/ui/list_loop_mutate.jet:2:19
    |
  2 |      nums: [Int]  = [1, 2]
    |                   ^
 Why: when the type is written, immutable uses `#=` and mutable uses `:=` (D-BIND3)
 Fix: write `nums: <Type> :=` instead of `nums: <Type> =`
